    "created_at": "2017-04-24T11:53:47Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-04-24T11:53:47Z",
    "body": "Another confusion: If the values of FrozenArray\\<T\\> have values that are references (\"unlike sequence types, which are lists of values that are passed by value\"), does FrozenArray\\<DictionaryType\\> make sense? Can dictionaries be passed by reference?\r\n\r\nI'm trying to implement a spec that has a FrozenArray\\<DictionaryType\\> attribute: https://w3c.github.io/webrtc-pc/#dom-rtccertificate-fingerprints",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
