    "created_at": "2017-04-24T11:57:34Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-04-24T11:57:34Z",
    "body": "\"Dictionaries are always passed by value. ... any dictionary returned from a platform object will be a copy and modifications made to it will not be visible to the platform object.\" https://www.w3.org/TR/WebIDL-1/#idl-dictionaries\r\n\r\nWell, FrozenArray\\<DictionaryType\\> is still handy to have (and used in several places in the webrtc spec), the implementation just has to make sure that the elements are copied.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
